<div class='container chu-editor w-3/4'>
  <h1 class='border-b-2 font-bold border-blue-darker pb-4 inline-block'>About</h1>
  <article class='mt-4'>
    <p>
      Chuspace is a collaborative publishing platform for developers, just like Github but for blogging. In short, it's Github for blogging.
    </p>

    <h3>Publishing experience</h3>
    <p>
      To make publishing experience simple, we have made a beautiful online markdown editor
      that shows real-time previews as you type.

      <br/>However, you are not limited to it, you can use any editor you like to write
      markdown and publish using Git, as you publish code.
    </p>


